[0.000, "o", "xt\":\"The photo gallery displays photos in a grid layout with filtering and pagination. The main selectors are: .photo-grid for the container, .photo-card for individual cards, #year-select for year filtering, and standard pagination controls. Images have a data-fallback attribute for placeholder handling. The test database contains 14 photos across years 2008, 2014, and 2026. Year filtering works by selecting from a dropdown and clicking Apply Filters, which can be reset with Clear Filters. Pagination supports page sizes of 10, 25, 50, 100, and 250, with navigation via First, Prev, Next, and Last links.\",\"explanation\":\"I explored the photo gallery application by navigating through the UI and examining the HTML structure from the preloaded templates. The tests cover three main scenarios: (1) verifying all images load with valid HTTP 200 responses and don't use placeholder fallbacks, (2) testing year filtering by selecting a year, applying the filter, verifying filtered results, and clearing the filter, and (3)"]
[0.000, "o", " testing pagination by setting page size to 10, navigating through pages using Next/Prev/First/Last buttons, and verifying correct image counts on each page. All selectors are based on actual elements found in the templates (photo-grid, photo-card, #year-select, etc.) and the browser exploration confirmed these work correctly.\",\"confidence\":0.95}\r\n"]
